  "title": "review: Planner prompt allows fresh read-only scout subagents (never forks), in CLAUDE.md and .orchestrator/prompts/planner.md together",
  "spec": "Goal T-1403, wave 2, plan label D4.\n\nFacts (main 355583c):\n- The headless Planner system prompt is .orchestrator/prompts/planner.md (read by orchestrator/goals.py:349 and\n  checked at :404-406; planner_shadow.py:47). The interactive Planner reads CLAUDE.md.\n- Both files carry the same rule in '## Never': 'Fork this session or spawn an Agent that inherits its context;\n  spawn fresh workers.' and '## Always' step 2: 'Default to zero scouts ... Use one targeted scout only when\n  plan.md records a named uncertainty ...'. Nothing says a fresh Agent-tool subagent may be the scout.\n- tests/test_goals.py::test_planner_md_matches_claude_md_lists (~527-535) requires the first line, the Never\n  section and the Always section (up to '\\n\\nHeadless') to be identical in the two files. Any edit must land in both\n  files byte-identically.\n\nChange:\n1. In both files, Never bullet becomes: 'Fork this session or spawn an Agent that inherits its context. Fresh\n   read-only scout subagents (Agent tool, a read-only type such as Explore) are allowed for a named uncertainty;\n   they never write, and their findings land in plan.md.' (wording may be tightened; meaning must stay).\n2. In both files, Always step 2: 'Use one targeted scout (a scout bus task or a fresh read-only subagent) only when\n   plan.md records a named uncertainty whose answer could change implementation.'\n3. Do not change the first line, the Headless paragraph, or any other step.\n4. Add test_planner_prompt_allows_fresh_scout_subagents to the PlannerPromptAndConfig class in tests/test_goals.py.\n\nNote for the Planner: B3 also edits CLAUDE.md and must depend on D4.\n\nWork on the task branch cut from goal/T-1403. Commit first, then run the focused tests in the foreground; never background a command and never run the full gate. Write tests as unittest.TestCase methods using tests/_harness.py like the neighbouring tests.",
  "inputs": [
    "T-1437"
  ],
  "acceptance": [
    "tests/test_goals.py::test_planner_prompt_allows_fresh_scout_subagents: passes: the '## Never' section of both CLAUDE.md and .orchestrator/prompts/planner.md still forbids forking or an Agent that inherits the session context, and both state that fresh read-only scout subagents are allowed for a named uncertainty; test_planner_md_matches_claude_md_lists still passes",
    ".claude/hooks/tests-green.sh wt/THIS-TASK exits 0"
  ],
  "scope": [
    ".orchestrator/prompts/planner.md",
    "CLAUDE.md",
    "tests/test_goals.py"
  ],
