      "result": {
        "summary": "The diff matches the spec. Both CLAUDE.md and .orchestrator/prompts/planner.md get the same new Never bullet and Always step 2 text. The hunks show the first line, the Headless paragraph and the other steps are unchanged. The new test, test_planner_prompt_allows_fresh_scout_subagents, is a unittest method in PlannerPromptAndConfig and uses the existing _section helper. It checks that the Never section of both files still forbids forking or an Agent that inherits context, and that it allows fresh read-only scout subagents for a named uncertainty. The change adds a scout permission and no write or privilege path. The scouts stay read-only and their findings go to plan.md. I did not run the tests. The gate record shows one attempt with no red runs.",
